cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the µPULLI manuscript and this repository."
title: "uPULLI-figures: figure-reproduction code and source data for the µPULLI manuscript"
abstract: >-
  Self-contained code and source-data tables that regenerate the figures of the µPULLI
  manuscript (V. cholerae biofilm phenotyping): reimaging phenotype landscape, training-set
  classification (numerical + DINOv2 embeddings), clean-deletion projection, and cross-system
  generalization (compounds, K. pneumoniae, multispecies).
authors:
  - name: "[FILL: author list]"
    affiliation: "Bridges Lab, Carnegie Mellon University"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/BridgesLabCMU/uPULLI-figures"
